			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event1_enemy_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『グムムゥ……
じかんが　ないと　いうのに……▼
ええい！　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール！！
そこを　どかぬかっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
